5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this investment with a spirit of wisdom and a desire for clarity in our reporting.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree. We need a logical approach to ensure our current success isn't a mirage. I want to see the actual data on our holdings.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,A balanced view is essential. I believe we should examine our financial flexibility and the long-term demands of our portfolio.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited! I just want to make sure we aren't spending all our time hunting for people instead of picking great companies!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am interested in the reality of our delivery timelines. We should identify the obstacles that actually delay our progress.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the independent checks on holdings' reported figures and the appraisal needs at the last audit to see how we close our books.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off to understand our true returns.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I'll investigate the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm going to check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats! I want to see who's available!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will review the delivery records of two holdings and the security review time before first deployment.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
