60,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Looking at the candidates, Ledger Bridge seems the most harmonious. It is back-office software, avoiding the audit burdens of sensors or apparel sorting.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Ledger Bridge fits the profile of the financial tooling that led to our best exits and likely has the retention we need.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Ledger Bridge is the most fiscally prudent. It doesn't require the physical infrastructure of Fabric Loop or Harvest Sensor, protecting our reserves.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I love Ledger Bridge! It's software, so we don't need to find field crews or shift supervisors. Our partners can handle it!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Ledger Bridge avoids the medical security delays of Clinic Scheduler and the hardware shortages of Harvest Sensor. It is the most predictable choice.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,It is rare to find such immediate alignment. The logic of the archives and our current needs point in one direction.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, I agree. The risk of a three-quarter delay with Clinic Scheduler is too high compared to the stability of a reconciliation tool.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, and since it doesn't need a depot, we avoid the five-figure audit fees Servas mentioned. It is the only sustainable option.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! No warehouses, no medical records, no field crews. It's just a win-win-win!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"The evidence is conclusive. Ledger Bridge minimizes operational risk and maximizes the probability of a timely, profitable exit.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,I feel a great sense of peace with this decision. I am ready to cast my vote for Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I am also ready. The logical path is clear. I vote for Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minako,,"For the health of our partnership's finances, I vote for Ledger Bridge.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm so happy we all agree! I vote for Ledger Bridge!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I concur. I vote for Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
